stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Captured
 Captured --> Held: Incomplete body or invalid sender
 Captured --> Current: Restore HTML lines and exclude quoted history
 Current --> Held: No unique bounded sender contact run or explicit delegated ownership
 Current --> Proposed: Sender-bound contact lines
 Proposed --> Held: Missing contact snapshot or changed binding
 Proposed --> Pending: Versioned proposed finding
 Pending --> Held: Text, HTML or extraction policy changed
 Held --> Pending: Exact frozen evidence restored
 Pending --> Pending: Unchanged evidence replays frozen request
 Pending --> Recorded: Record layer acknowledges
 Recorded --> Recorded: Same source returns
 %% never Extract facts from quoted history or a competing identity.
 %% never Overwrite a human contact field.
 %% never Infer deletion from a folder label or missing message.
